ikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Twelve blush majesty two.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/dc/Twelve_blush_majesty_two..png/revision/latest?cb=20210211202453\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Twelve blush majesty two.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/dc/Twelve_blush_majesty_two..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210211202453\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/dc/Twelve_blush_majesty_two..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210211202453 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/dc/Twelve_blush_majesty_two..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210211202453 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Twelve blush majesty two.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Twelve_blush_majesty_two..png\" data-image-name=\"Twelve blush majesty two..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\">7</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Acaster\" title=\"James Acaster\">James Acaster</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/My_eyes_are_circles.\" title=\"My eyes are circles.\">My eyes are circles.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/OLLIE.\" title=\"OLLIE.\">OLLIE.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Twelve blush majesty two.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\">Series 7</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 19 September 2018. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/James_Acaster\" title=\"James Acaster\">James Acaster</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Twelve_blush_majesty_two.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Twelve blush majesty two\" was part of <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a>' misinterpretation of <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Wang\" title=\"Phil Wang\">Phil Wang</a>'s mouthed fact during the <a href=\"/wiki/Write_down_a_ten-word_fact\" title=\"Write down a ten-word fact\">Write down a ten-word fact</a> task. The title card shows a golf ball near a hole, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_ball_in_that_hole_in_as_few_strokes_as_possible\" title=\"Get this ball in that hole in as few strokes as possible\">Get this ball in that hole in as few strokes as possible</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Twelve_blush_majesty_two.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Skål rødmer majestæt to', which translates as 'Cheers blush majesty two'. It's unclear why they went with this Danish translation beginning with 'skål' ('cheers'), rather than just using 'tolv' ('twelve').<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Twelve_blush_majesty_two.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/James_Acaster\" title=\"James Acaster\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">James Acaster</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Knappett\" title=\"Jessica Knappett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jessica Knappett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Kerry_Godliman\" title=\"Kerry Godliman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Kerry Godliman</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Wang\" title=\"Phil Wang\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Wang</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rhod_Gilbert\" title=\"Rhod Gilbert\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rhod Gilbert</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_from_the_%2790s\" title=\"Best thing from the &#39;90s\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing from the '90s.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Excite_Alex\" title=\"Excite Alex\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Excite Alex.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_noise\" title=\"Make the best noise\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best noise. When you are ready to make your noise, you must say \"This is my best noise\". After you have made your noise, you must remain still and silent for at least 10 seconds.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_ball_in_that_hole_in_as_few_strokes_as_possible\" title=\"Get this ball in that hole in as few strokes as possible\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get this ball in that hole in as few strokes as possible. The ball must only be struck. The ball must never be carried.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write_down_a_ten-word_fact\" title=\"Write down a ten-word fact\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablerow\"><b>Live:</b> Write down a ten-word fact.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Mouth your fact to the Taskmaster without making any noise whatsoever.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Best fact.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">18\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Twelve_blush_majesty_two.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is one of four episodes in which the winner did not win any tasks, with the others being <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27ve_sinned_again.\" title=\"I&#39;ve sinned again.\">I've sinned again.</a></span>, <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags.\" title=\"A novel about Russian Gulags.\">A novel about Russian Gulags.</a></span>, and <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Put_that_on_my_gravestone.\" title=\"Put that on my gravestone.\">Put that on my gravestone.</a></span>.\n<ul><li>However, one may consider James to have won the live task in this episode due to coming second and receiving the bonus point, with Alex announcing him and Jessica as joint winners.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Twelve_blush_majesty_two.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_7,_Episode_3_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Twelve_Blush_Majesty_Two%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/65/Taskmaster_-_Series_7%2C_Episode_3_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Twelve_Blush_Majesty_Two%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003937\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_7,_Episode_3_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Twelve_Blush_Majesty_Two&#39;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_7,_Episode_3_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Twelve_Blush_Majesty_Two&#39;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 7, Episode 3 - Full Episode - &#39;Twelve Blush Majesty Two&#39;\" class=\"\" /> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t<svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\" aria-label=\"Pl